    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A well-presented top-floor two-bedroom apartment with a balcony, ideally located in the popular and convenient area of Chapelizod.\r\n\r\nNo. 21 St Laurence Glen offers approximately 50.47 sq. m. of well-proportioned accommodation. The property benefits from being situated on the top floor and with the added benefit of a private balcony, providing a pleasant outdoor space, sense of privacy and a natural light throughout. The property comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright living/dining area, a fitted kitchen, two bedrooms and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 1995, the property has a BER rating of C, offering a good balance of comfort and energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nSt Laurence Glen is located close to the village of Chapelizod, with a range of local shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities nearby. The area also provides excellent access to Dublin City Centre, with a choice of public transport options and easy access to the M50 and N4.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n- Two-bedroom top-floor apartment\r\n- One bathroom\r\n- Approximately 50.47 sq. m.\r\n- BER C\r\n- Built in 1995\r\n- Excellent location in Chapelizod\r\n\r\nAsking price: €325,000\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this property has to offer."
      },
      {
